ECHO: "DRC", "NOTE", "key cap stands proud of the top face at rest", 3, "mm = the travel"
ECHO: "DRC", "PASS", "cap hole clearance beats oak cross-grain movement across the hole", 0.75, "mm per side vs 0.27 mm of movement at 1.5 % (ADR 0009)"
