ECHO: "DRC", "PASS", "U-bolt nuts bear on the backplate, which stops at the gap fasteners' clearance", [2.82457, 4.25, 0.5], "mm: a nut's corners inside the plate end; plate beyond each leg hole; plate end short of the screws' clearance circle, which must beat the 0.25 mm the plate floats on its legs"
